<section class="band" style="--hero-image: url('{{ '/assets/img/bonfire.jpg' | url }}')">
  <div class="container"><h2>Lodging at The Well</h2></div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container prose">
    <p>We’ve chosen to move from tent lodging to shared RV accommodations for The Well. This allows for a more comfortable and restful retreat experience while still preserving the heart of shared community.</p>
    <p>You’ll share an RV with 6–8 women, and this is often where some of the most meaningful moments of the weekend naturally unfold—late-night conversations, shared laughter, quiet prayer, and connection that continues long after the retreat ends.</p>
    <p>Think sleepaway camp… but elevated, cozy, and full of meaningful sisterhood.</p>
    <h3>Each RV includes:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Comfortable beds (perfect for late-night giggles and heart-to-hearts)</li>
      <li>Indoor bathrooms and showers (no trekking anywhere)</li>
      <li>Climate control for a good night’s rest</li>
      <li>Outlets for phones and personal items</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Please note:</strong> <em>linens are not provided</em>, and laundry facilities are not available during the retreat. We recommend packing your own sheets, pillow, and blanket so you’re comfortable all weekend.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" style="--hero-image: url('{{ '/assets/img/food-bg.jpg' | url }}')">
  <div class="container"><h2>Food &amp; Dietary Needs</h2></div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container prose">
    <p>Meals are provided throughout the retreat.</p>
    <p>You’ll have the opportunity to note any dietary restrictions or allergies during registration. We do our best to accommodate common needs such as vegetarian and gluten-free options.</p>
    <p>Due to the nature of group meal preparation, we may not be able to accommodate all dietary preferences. If you have a severe or life-threatening food allergy, please let us know in advance so we can plan accordingly and ensure your safety.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" style="--hero-image: url('{{ '/assets/img/packing.jpg' | url }}')">
  <div class="container"><h2>What to Pack</h2></div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container prose">
    <p>A full packing list will be emailed to you before the retreat.</p>
    <p>In general, we recommend bringing:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Comfortable, casual clothing</li>
      <li>Outdoor-friendly shoes</li>
      <li>Personal toiletries</li>
      <li>Your own linens (sheets, pillow, and blanket)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Think practical, cozy, and ready to rest.</p>
  </div>
</section>
